# m5_graze: the m2_play sweep (without its two holds) plus B held for updates 1630..1649, so
# the bar is spent before the ship meets bullets and a graze can show up in it (a full bar
# would cap the grant). Since M7 it plays in the endless probe mode (debug_probe at 31; a
# normal game dies on this sweep), and the hold moved from 1960 to 1600 to find a clean graze
# in the M7 waves, then to 1630 for the catch-up table clock (a thin field runs the stage
# table faster; at 1600 the ship never re-lived the graze it took back). 1629: game tick
# 1599, fuel 180, 13 grazes, 6 probe hits. 1649, the last held frame: 20 frames = 40 ticks,
# game tick 1559, fuel 140; the hold took back the graze of 1627 (grazes 12) and the probe
# hit of 1629 (hits 5). 1650: PLAYING, no tick.
# - 1678 (tick 1587): the ship re-lives that graze: grazes 12 -> 13, but it is under the
#   graze high-water mark, so it pays nothing (fuel 143 before and after).
# - 1772 (tick 1681): a new graze: grazes 13 -> 14 and fuel 153 -> 155. Refill alone cannot
#   get there: 122 live ticks since the release (1559 -> 1681) give at most 140 + (9 + 122) /
#   10 = 153 (9 = the most the refill counter can carry in), and the fuel is 155.
# No rewind is spent (probe mode never rewinds; rewinds stay 3).
--frames 2200 --call-at "31 debug_probe" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_rewinds,debug_fuel,debug_grazes --at "1629 debug_state == 1" --at "1629 debug_game_tick == 1599" --at "1629 debug_fuel == 180" --at "1629 debug_grazes == 13" --at "1629 debug_hits == 6" --at "1630 debug_state == 5" --at "1649 debug_game_tick == 1559" --at "1649 debug_fuel == 140" --at "1649 debug_grazes == 12" --at "1649 debug_hits == 5" --at "1650 debug_state == 1" --at "1660 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1677 debug_grazes == 12" --at "1677 debug_fuel == 143" --at "1678 debug_grazes == 13" --at "1678 debug_fuel == 143" --at "1771 debug_grazes == 13" --at "1771 debug_fuel == 153" --at "1772 debug_game_tick == 1681" --at "1772 debug_grazes == 14" --at "1772 debug_fuel == 155" --at "1772 debug_history_check == 0" --expect "debug_state == 1" --expect "debug_rewinds == 3" --expect "debug_grazes >= 14"
